// The first species retrofitted onto the shared organism substrate --
// Reports/organism-substrate-design.md's own retrofit order, chosen for
// being the simplest possible smoke test (one cell type, no transport,
// no thickening, no roots). Reproduces `plant.rs`'s old MOSS_DAMP_CHANCE
// (0.35) / MOSS_DRY_CHANCE (0.002) split exactly -- see `organism.rs`'s
// `Divide` doc for why those are separate fields rather than one
// generalized chance, and why `cost: 0.0` is a real, deliberate value
// rather than a placeholder: moss never had an energy budget before this
// retrofit, and giving it one would be a bigger behavioural change than
// this rewrite is meant to make silently.
(
    name: "moss",
    cell_types: [
        (GrowingTip, [
            Divide(
                cost: 0.0,
                damp_chance: 0.35,
                dry_chance: 0.002,
                shade_sensitive: true,
            ),
        ]),
    ],
)
